Subject: [M152] Harden GestureEventQueue, MouseWheelEventQueue, and
 TouchpadPinchEventQueue

Original change's description:
> Harden GestureEventQueue, MouseWheelEventQueue, and TouchpadPinchEventQueue
>
> Follow up to crrev.com/c/7776327 and crrev.com/c/7919026. This change
> hardens the remaining input queues embedded in InputRouterImpl against
> synchronous destruction during ACK processing if an ACK callback
> triggers synchronous UI actions (e.g. overscroll navigation, popup
> dismissals, or context menu loops) that destroy the owning
> RenderWidgetHostImpl / InputRouterImpl.
>
> Bug: 554953456, 552283275
> Change-Id: I9b65eeeb1f9478275ae29bb52afc41de8c6011ed
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8328368
